     01 E0   -000111100000
0x0C034000 :01 3C :  051F0900 0200F000 57A11000 -> 01 00 00 3C  00 00 02 BC  ... ??? WRONG!
    57A11000 - 01010111101000010001000000000000
    2BC     - 001010111100
*/